              <a href="#common-deck-cleaning-mistakes-that" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Common Deck Cleaning Mistakes That Ruin the Stain Job</a>
              <a href="#best-time-of-year-to" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Best Time of Year to Clean a Deck Before Staining</a>
